Domain Entity BalanceSheetDimension
    documentation "The NCES balance sheet accounting dimension, used to track financial transactions for each fund. These financial statements only report assets, deferred outflows of resources, liabilities, deferred inflows of resources, and equity accounts. The statements are considered snapshots of how these accounts stand as of a certain point in time."
    shared string Code
        documentation "The code representation of the account balance sheet dimension."
        is part of identity
    shared integer LocalFiscalYear named FiscalYear
        documentation "The fiscal year for which the account balance sheet dimension is valid."
        is part of identity
    shared string CodeName
        documentation "A description of the account balance sheet dimension."
        is optional
    descriptor ReportingTag
        documentation "Optional tag for accountability reporting."
        is optional collection
